bel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:203805","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"八日 なのか","creatorId":"vndb:s4808","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4808","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4808","name":"八日なのか","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:203807","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"朝霧 はやと","creatorId":"vndb:s8821","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8821","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8821","name":"朝霧 隼翔","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:203812","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"伊藤 タテキ","creatorId":"vndb:s11466","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11466","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11466","name":"伊藤 タテキ","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:203813","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"冬乃 桜","creatorId":"vndb:s12797","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s12797","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s12797","name":"冬乃 桜","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:203814","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"小日向 千虎","creatorId":"vndb:s33989","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s33989","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s33989","name":"小日向 千虎","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:203817","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c125790","characterName":"こころん","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"128933","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"420595"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24808"],"vndbCharacterId":"c125790"},"originalCharacterName":"こころん","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A Maiden Longing for an Ideal Love"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Grade: Second-year/internal student, women's basketball club​ member"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Boldly changes her image to make her co-educational school debut, a fairy tale maiden who dreams of meeting a destined prince riding a white horse. However, all of those are destroyed by Kanata, and they end up having a feud every time they see each other. While she is feeling heartbroken due to the different reality from what she had expected, she is still a maiden longing for love and cannot easily give up her ideal. Despite being bad at it, she is enthusiastic about her club activities, even though she has no sense of fashion at all, she is trying hard to be fashionable. While the results may not come easily, her friends completely appreciate her merits."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"My charming prince on a white horse────Only the horse came though.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c125790"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"共学化デビューしようと大胆にイメチェンし、白馬の王子様と運命的な出会いをすることを夢見ていたメルヘン乙女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしそのことごとくを叶太にぶち壊されてしまったため、顔を合わせるたびいがみ合う関係に。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"思ってたんと違いすぎる現実にめげそうになりながらも、理想を捨てきれない恋に恋する乙女でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"下手だけど部活に熱心だったり、センスはまるでないけどオシャレしようとする頑張り屋さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なかなか報われない、そんな彼女の良さを友人たちはちゃんと理解してくれている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24808","sourceWorkId":"34260","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あたしの白馬の王子様────馬だけ来たんだけど」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"共学化デビューしようと大胆にイメチェンし、白馬の王子様と運命的な出会いをすることを夢見ていたメルヘン乙女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしそのことごとくを叶太にぶち壊されてしまったため、顔を合わせるたびいがみ合う関係に。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"思ってたんと違いすぎる現実にめげそうになりながらも、理想を捨てきれない恋に恋する乙女でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"下手だけど部活に熱心だったり、センスはまるでないけどオシャレしようとする頑張り屋さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なかなか報われない、そんな彼女の良さを友人たちはちゃんと理解してくれている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"128933"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f4/f4540d927825180a2e3989ab742ee7707e421736d8fec194108e02076f73b496.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8e/8edb588ce611c3dc4e9d607604a60a3b9b05e4504e61caf1c3bad09227a4a2bb.webp","width":84,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"あさみほとり","creatorId":"vndb:s902","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s902","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s902","name":"あさみ ほとり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:475925:128933:11646:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c125791","characterName":"アダチー","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"128934","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"420595"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24809"],"vndbCharacterId":"c125791"},"originalCharacterName":"アダチー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An Estranged Childhood Friend Living Next Door"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Grade: Second-year/external student, women's basketball club​ member"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kanata's neighbor and childhood friend. Due to puberty, there were times when they felt somewhat conscious of each other, so for a while, they became estranged. She sees Kanata as a proactive fool in everything and does not want him to talk to her too much in public. Even though she is mixed in when talking about love, she does not know about love herself, and her naivety tends to confuse the surroundings. When she is absorbed in something, she becomes lively like a child. She loves basketball, and she is expected to be the next ace of the team."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I told you not to talk to me at school.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c125791"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"叶太のお隣さんで幼馴染み。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"思春期にはお互い多少意識することもあったが、しばらく疎遠となっていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"叶太がなにかと前のめりなバカだと知っており、あまり人前では話しかけてきてほしくないと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋バナに混じりはするけど、自身は色恋に疎く、その天然っぷりを発揮し周囲を混乱させることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夢中になると、子どもみたいにはしゃぐことがある。バスケが大好きで、次期エースと期待されている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24809","sourceWorkId":"34260","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「学校では話しかけてこないでってば」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"叶太のお隣さんで幼馴染み。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"思春期にはお互い多少意識することもあったが、しばらく疎遠となっていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"叶太がなにかと前のめりなバカだと知っており、あまり人前では話しかけてきてほしくないと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋バナに混じりはするけど、自身は色恋に疎く、その天然っぷりを発揮し周囲を混乱させることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夢中になると、子どもみたいにはしゃぐことがある。バスケが大好きで、部活の次期エースと期待されている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"128934"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d2/d2b629242f2707159c58dc96403e3b61655be8c4f108d7c203fe1d810da17edd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/94/94615af65bd3d6e452ec83a7c6880eae9960b80096008bc4a76bb36030bc4484.webp","width":64,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"加藤陽菜乃","creatorId":"vndb:s17737","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s17737","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s17737","name":"加藤 陽菜乃","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:475925:128934:35572:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c125792","characterName":"めぐりセンパイ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"128935","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"420595"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24810"],"vndbCharacterId":"c125792"},"originalCharacterName":"めぐりセンパイ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An Angel Descending to the Earth, a Fairy Dancing in the Spring Breeze"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Grade: Third-year/internal student, women's basketball club​ member"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A senpai whom Kanata falls in love with at first sight. She is the current ace of the women's basketball team and the object of admiration for Kokoro. Due to her looks and a cheerful personality, she captivates not only the boys, but the girls as well. She kindly evades the boys' invitations, but is not in any way used to it, since she grows up in an all-girls school. She has a younger sister who is the student council president. Meguri herself is a siscon, and always secretly protecting her sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Oh, it's the Dogeza-kun from this morning.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c125792"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"叶太が一目惚れしたセンパイ。女子バスケ部のエースで、こころの憧れの的でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その容姿と陽気な性格で、男子のみならず女子までもを魅了している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"余裕ぶった態度でのらりくらりと男子からの誘いを躱すも、女子校育ちなので決して慣れているワケではない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生徒会長であるいのりのお姉ちゃんで、だいぶヤバメなシスコン。いつも密かに妹を守護っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24810","sourceWorkId":"34260","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あれ、今朝の土下座くんだあ」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"叶太が一目惚れしたセンパイ。女子バスケ部の現エースで、こころの憧れの的でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その容姿と陽気な性格で、男子のみならず女子までもを魅了している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"余裕ぶった態度でのらりくらりと男子からの誘いを躱すも、女子校育ちなので決して慣れているワケではない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生徒会長である妹がおり、だいぶヤバメなシスコン。いつも密かに妹を守護っている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"128935"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a9/a9af241681a405b50b8e45005bd8b17a0ba2850cb44b858bd8fbf8dad554a973.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2e/2eb5750d4bb20d6edab41aef472989b103872348be42f149ce297126836fcbf2.webp","width":116,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"空賀花","creatorId":"vndb:s15476","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s15476","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s15476","name":"空賀 花","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:475925:128935:34089:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c125793","characterName":"トコちゃん","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"128936","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"420595"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24811"],"vndbCharacterId":"c125793"},"originalCharacterName":"トコちゃん","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A Talkative, but Emotionless Kouhai"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Grade: First-year/internal student, student council secretary"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mysterious kouhai who never laughs. She rarely shows emotion, but is very talkative, and becomes tired when she talks a lot. Even though she is shy, strangely, she feels very familiar to Kanata, but still a mysterious girl nonetheless. Also, she does not have any friends. Perhaps because of thinking that she will be rich if she can smile naturally, she takes a lot of part-time jobs, so she can be found everywhere. She currently lives with her father who is the school principal."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"My smile is one hundred million yen.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c125793"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"まったく笑わない謎多き後輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"感情の起伏こそ少ないがその代わりよくしゃべる。そして、いっぱいしゃべると疲れてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人見知りするくせに妙に馴れ馴れしかったり、とにかく不思議な女の子。ちなみに友達はいない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お金持ちになれば自然と笑みがこぼれるのではないかと思い、たくさんバイトしているせいか、いろんなところで会う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"校長である父親とふたり暮らし。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24811","sourceWorkId":"34260","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「わたしのスマイルいちおくえん」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まったく笑わない謎多き後輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"感情の起伏こそ少ないがその代わりよくしゃべる。そして、いっぱいしゃべると疲れてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人見知りするくせに妙に馴れ馴れしかったり、とにかく不思議な女の子。ちなみに友達はいない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お金持ちになれば自然と笑みがこぼれるのではないかと思い、たくさんバイトしているせいか、いろんなところで会う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"校長である父親とふたり暮らし。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"128936"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/01/01fd95ff7318e5931d14b5594b9c28527338aaaa81f458d3144f3a06dd50f6d5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/60/60c7a830ec0e5ef83b7731864a215fb542507e4276f35069df2a585752b0a281.webp","width":73,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"七種結花","creatorId":"vndb:s22881","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s22881","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s22881","name":"佐藤 詩乃","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:475925:128936:56606:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c128221","characterName":"畔 小雀","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c128221"},"originalCharacterName":"畔 小雀","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/63/631def71211f2eef9c172d752f0895d4659e1de4983ce8f1dd0828f3642a699a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4e/4edb5894e5f97601155138e2c1e0bd750f5304d5897bd7eb841828ae5020ccef.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"夜空 あかり","creatorId":"vndb:s34489","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s34489","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s34489","name":"夜空 あかり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:97065","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c128222","characterName":"遙 叶梨","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c128222"},"originalCharacterName":"遙 叶梨","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kanata's younger sister. She doesn't look like her brother, but they seem to share the way of getting angry."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She neither loves nor hates her brother too much. But like the childhood friend, she doesn't really want to meet him at school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her brother is her brother, and she accepts him, but she wants him to calm down a little more. As for her mother, Kanari has long since given up on her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is good friends with Chii, and is somehow unilaterally treated as a good friend by Tokoyo."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c128222"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/76/766807b21978e420e2a3185728d2622257aedd02dbd3b12148925a6e2d3c7f47.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/81/81a50a3120afda810290af28d67bf8619e00cbe4ceaca75398a350565a1b623f.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"碓氷 珊瑚","creatorId":"vndb:s34488","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s34488","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s34488","name":"木南 向葵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","